      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "セキュリティ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Security"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今すぐロック": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PINを変更": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change PIN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生体認証で解錠": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlock with Biometrics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Face ID / Touch ID でロックを解除します。鍵は生体認証付きのKeychainに保管されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlock with Face ID / Touch ID. The key is stored in the biometric-protected Keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ロック": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自動ロック": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-Lock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10回失敗で全消去": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erase all after 10 failures"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即時": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Immediately"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1分後": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After 1 min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5分後": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After 5 min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バックアップ / 復元": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup / Restore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスフレーズで暗号化したファイルを書き出し／読み込みできます。機種変更時の移行にも使えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export/import a passphrase-encrypted file. Useful when switching devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud同期": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今すぐ同期": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同期しました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synced"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メモは端末内で暗号化してから同期するため、クラウド上には暗号文しか保存されません。同じPINを設定した端末どうしで内容を共有できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are encrypted on-device before syncing, so only ciphertext is stored in the cloud. Devices with the same PIN share the same content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おとり保管庫": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decoy Vault"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おとりPINを設定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Decoy PIN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おとりPINを変更": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change Decoy PIN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おとり保管庫を削除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete Decoy Vault"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本来のPINとは別のPINを設定できます。そのPINを入力すると、本来の内容とは切り離された別の保管庫が開きます。PINの開示を強要された場合などに本来の内容を守るための機能です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set a PIN separate from your real one. Entering it opens a vault isolated from your real content — a feature to protect your data if you are forced to reveal a PIN."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全データを消去": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erase All Data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべての保管庫・メモ・鍵を端末（および同期済みならiCloud）から完全に削除します。取り消せません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permanently deletes all vaults, notes, and keys from this device (and iCloud if synced). This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バックアップ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "書き出し": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "読み込み": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスフレーズ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passphrase"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスフレーズ（確認）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
